{"id":"experimento","lemma":"experimento","pos":"noun","rank":2225,"glosses":["experiment"],"ipa":"/eɡspeɾiˈmento/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"experimentos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-experimento.wav","examples":[{"text":"El experimento fue un éxito.","en":"The experiment was successful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/606460","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"success"}]},{"text":"Ya sé que es un experimento.","en":"I know it's an experiment.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611853","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"El experimento debe comenzar.","en":"The experiment has to begin.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to begin, to commence"}]},{"text":"Él continuó con su experimento.","en":"He carried on with his experiment.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735434","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to continue","l":"continuar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"El experimento confirmó su teoría.","en":"The experiment confirmed his theory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687431","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to confirm","l":"confirmar"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"theory"}]}]}